{"id":"beda15b0668c707f","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-many-one-reducible.md","title":"Many-One Reducibility","display":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-many-one-reducible","aliases":["58-df-many-one-reducible"],"display":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducibility","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-many-one-reducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-many-one-reducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afc30501f405cff5\" href=\"?note=afc30501f405cff5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afc30501f405cff5\" href=\"?note=afc30501f405cff5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ManyOneReducible}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ManyOneReducible}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\\mathrm{ManyOneReducible}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\\mathrm{ManyOneReducible}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Many-one 归约是 Turing 归约的特例</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> 在复杂度类研究中很重要</li>\n<li>1-归约要求归约函数为单射，因此强于一般的 many-one 归约。</li>\n<li>many-one 度细分可计算可枚举集；存在 many-one 完备的可计算可枚举集，但并非所有此类集合都完备。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 在可计算原像下封闭，因而对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> 向下封闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"afc30501f405cff5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"afc30501f405cff5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursion2-total-computable-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ManyOneReducible}_S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\\mathrm{ManyOneReducible}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TotalComputableMap}_S(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false}],"bytes":1251,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-813","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-many-one-reducible.md|58-df-many-one-reducible]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["afc30501f405cff5"]}